<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CSR provisional A2 Moody's ratings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CSR provisional A2 Moody's ratings.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday it had assigned a provisional rating of (P) A2 to CSR Ltd's US$400 million shelf registration.</p>
</text>
